t-specific requirements and a verified 2027 university call. Check deadlines before choosing your application.\",\"image\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/images/design/china/china-5-1280.webp\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-10-19\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-10-19\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"AspireCompass Editorial Team\",\"url\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/editorial-policy/\"},\"publisher\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"AspireCompass\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/logo.svg\"}},\"mainEntityOfPage\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/scholarships/shanghai-government-scholarship/\"}"}}],["$","script","3",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is Shanghai Government Scholarship the same as CSC?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No. SGS is a Shanghai municipal scholarship. Its Type A/B funding classes should not be confused with CSC application categories.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is there one SGS deadline?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No. Universities publish their own schedules and can use different dates by degree.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Does SGS Type B cover living costs?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The reviewed SHOU Type B covers tuition and medical insurance. Check the specific host offer and budget for other costs.\"}}]}"}}]],["$","section",null,{"className":"inner-hero inner-hero--compact inner-hero--guide inner-hero--visual","children":"$L18"}],false,"$L19","$L1a"]}]
